</section>

<!-- ============ ABOUT ============ -->
<section id="about">
  <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">Data-first, business-minded.</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">A quick look at who I am and how I work.</p>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="avatar">AS</div>
      <ul class="fact-list">
        <li>Location <b>Bengaluru, India</b></li>
        <li>Email <b>aarav.analyst@mail.com</b></li>
        <li>Certification <b>PW Skills — Data Analytics</b></li>
        <li>Availability <b>Open to work</b></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy reveal">
      <p>I'm a <b>certified Data Analyst</b> from PW Skills, trained to take messy, real-world data and turn it into dashboards, reports, and models that non-technical stakeholders can trust and act on.</p>
      <p>My workflow starts with the question, not the dataset: what decision is this meant to support? From there I clean and structure the data in <b>SQL and Python</b>, explore it for patterns, and present the findings through <b>Power BI or Tableau</b> dashboards that stand on their own in a meeting.</p>
      <p>I enjoy the last mile of analytics most — the point where a chart stops being "interesting" and starts being <b>actionable</b>. That's the bar I hold every project to.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ SKILLS ============ -->
<section id="skills" style="background:var(--bg-elev);">
